    "body": "Via BrowserStack, I checked the tests in Safari 15.4 on an iPhone 13, Chrome and Firefox on Android 12 on a Google Pixel 6. There were no surprises other than a test bug which I've submitted a fix for at https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/33811\r\n\r\nI haven't checked Deno or Node, other than the results for the relevant tests are `MISSING` for Deno on wpt.fyi: https://wpt.fyi/results/dom/nodes/Document-createEvent.https.html?sha=937311ebfd&label=master&max-count=1&product=chrome&product=edge&product=firefox&product=safari&product=deno",
